 "why": "Seeded 18-09-2026 in the commit that adopts the rule. These are the ALL-scope adopted lessons carrying no promotion declaration on the day the rule was written. Requiring a declaration on all of them at once would be the permanently-red check [R-ENF-02] forbids \u2014 ruling on each is a judgement per lesson and that is the work this list schedules. THE LIST IS THE WORK ORDER: it may only ever SHORTEN, and a lesson added after adoption with no declaration is a NEW breach, which is the debt this rule is actually about. The twelve lessons declared at adoption are the eleven from the 18-09-2026 forensic audits plus L-055 and L-056, which a standing rule and a shared instrument plainly bind.",
